    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/holyvaley-blessington-wicklow-w91-n2h9\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present Holyvalley, Blessington in Wicklow.\r\n\r\nNestled in the charming location of Holyvalley, Blessington, Wicklow, this detached, four-bedroom residence beautifully combines comfort, space, and functionality. As you approach the property, you are greeted by a well-presented front lawn and a generous driveway area, providing ample parking space. The home’s light-toned detached façade and dark pitched roofline give it a clean, classic appearance.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, the hallway leads to a bright and inviting living room, featuring a large window that allows natural light to fill the space. To the rear, the generous kitchen/dining area offers excellent proportions, modern cabinetry, ample countertop space, and a convenient layout for everyday family living, with direct access to the garden, ideal for entertaining guests or enjoying al fresco dining.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes four bedrooms, offering strong flexibility for growing families, guests, or home office use. The ground floor includes a well-proportioned bedroom, while the upper floor provides three further bedrooms of varying sizes, with useful storage options in selected rooms adding to the practicality of the layout. A well-appointed bathroom is positioned on the ground floor, further enhancing everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe outdoor space is a true asset, featuring a private rear garden ideal for active children, gardening enthusiasts, or simply enjoying the serene greenery. Located conveniently near primary roads, the home offers excellent connectivity with Blessington's amenities such as schools, shops, and local sports clubs. The property is also within a comfortable distance from local transport options.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful home is a perfect match for families seeking a spacious residence in a peaceful neighbourhood, or those looking to trade up for a property that offers both comfort and practicality. With its generous living space, strategic location, and elegant design, it represents an excellent opportunity for prospective buyers."
      },
